scope one repair to the roster runner, its pen, and its witness; one paper; the card and its shelf
status GREEN -- tools/s/standing_equipment_witness.rish green on metal, both mutations proven to bite, first resident on the real runner naming the path; hot pass to follow this log into the same commit
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- may construction/fleet-claims.kyri be read past by the run digest, as the runner's own gitignored card already is? A tracked file every ship writes mid-lap by instruction is the same kind of thing, and weakening a digest is a word rather than a repair.
